{"id":"cce22fc8a4f2f9e3","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-very-strong-equality-compat.md","title":"very-strong-equality — 历史入口","display":"very-strong-equality — 历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-very-strong-equality-compat","aliases":["16-df-very-strong-equality-compat","16-very-strong-equality"],"display":"very-strong-equality — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]"],"source":"§3.4, p. 192 (PDF 212)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-very-strong-equality-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-very-strong-equality-compat</span><span>16-very-strong-equality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"very-strong-equality — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2143c499aae70cc\" href=\"?note=f2143c499aae70cc\" title=\"16-df-very-strong-equality\">16-df-very-strong-equality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§3.4, p. 192 (PDF 212)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是 Eq-fibration；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2143c499aae70cc\" href=\"?note=f2143c499aae70cc\" title=\"16-df-very-strong-equality\">16-df-very-strong-equality</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 为旧拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}very\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}very\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>内部相等反映外部箭头相等；不以等式伴随单位可逆来替代此条件。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§3.4, p. 192 (PDF 212)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-very-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-very-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p$ 是 Eq-fibration；$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}$ 见 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]]，$\\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为旧拼写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}very\\text{-}strong\\text{-}equality}\\vdash\\quad \\mathsf{VStrongEq}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p).","display":true}],"bytes":920,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-380","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-very-strong-equality-compat|very-strong-equality — 历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["f2143c499aae70cc"]}